---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">
  <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4">Status: Welcome</h2>
      <h1 class="text-6xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-8 tracking-tighter italic">
        HEY!
      </h1>
      <div class="prose-engineering text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed [&>p:last-child]:mb-0">
        <p>
          I'm Adrian. I'm a recent robotics engineering graduate and someone who is striving to become an engineer of clever products that make lives 
          better. Multi-disciplinary engineering and specifically robotic/mechatronic systems are my passion. I enjoy working on projects 
          that blend creativity and uniqueness with technical competence, and challenge me to confront difficult problems. Sometimes I succeed, 
          sometimes I fail, but I always find that I'm happier by the end and do it all over again. This website curates some of my favourite projects 
          that I've worked on or that I'm currently working on, along with some of the things I've learned along the way.
        </p>
        
        <p class="mt-8 p-6 bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-600 rounded-r-xl text-slate-800 shadow-sm text-base">
          I'm currently looking for entry-level roles along the lines of robotics/mechatronics systems design, systems integration, or R&D. Through my
          projects, schooling, and past internships, I've gained mechatronics/robotics experience in a variety of areas, ranging from medical robotics 
          to industrial automation in automotive manufacturing. If you happen to like what you see here and think I might be a good fit for your team, 
          please don't hesitate to download my resume below and reach out!
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-24">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4">Skills</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl">
          <h3 class="text-xs font-black text-cyan-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Software</h3>
          <ul class="font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-700 space-y-1">
            <li>Python (NumPy, OpenCV, PyTorch)</li>
            <li>C (Embedded Focus)</li>
            <li>ROS 2</li>
            <li>MATLAB // Simulink</li>
            <li>Linux</li>
            <li>Git // CI/CD</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="p-6 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl">
          <h3 class="text-xs font-black text-cyan-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Electrical / Embedded</h3>
          <ul class="font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-700 space-y-1">
            <li>Embedded Linux (Nvidia Jetson, RPI)</li>
            <li>Microcontrollers (ESP32, STM32, Arduino)</li>
            <li>I2C, SPI, Ethernet, CAN/CAN-FD</li>
            <li>PCB Design (KiCAD, EaglePCB)</li>
            <li>Oscilloscopes // Function Generators</li>
            <li>Soldering & Wire Harnessing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="p-6 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl">
          <h3 class="text-xs font-black text-cyan-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Mechanical</h3>
          <ul class="font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-700 space-y-1">
            <li>SOLIDWORKS // Fusion360 // AutoCAD</li>
            <li>3D Printing (FDM/SLA)</li>
            <li>Laser Cutting</li>
            <li>Basic Machining</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-24 p-8 bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl text-white flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 shadow-2xl">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2 tracking-tight">Resume_Adrian_Shkumbov.pdf</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 font-mono text-sm">Size: 1.2MB | Format: PDF</p>
      </div>
      <a 
        href="/Resume_Adrian_Shkumbov.pdf" 
        download 
        class="px-8 py-4 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold rounded-lg transition-all transform hover:scale-105 flex items-center gap-2"
      >
        <span>DOWNLOAD RESUME</span>
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3 17a1 1 0 011-1h12a1 1 0 110 2H4a1 1 0 01-1-1zm3.293-7.707a1 1 0 011.414 0L9 10.586V3a1 1 0 112 0v7.586l1.293-1.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-3 3a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-3-3a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-4 flex justify-center">
      <a 
        href="/projects" 
        class="group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-10 py-5 font-black text-white transition-all duration-200 bg-amber-500 font-mono text-lg uppercase tracking-widest rounded-2xl hover:bg-amber-400 hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-10px_rgba(245,158,11,0.5)] active:scale-95"
      >
        <span>Check out my projects</span>
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 ml-3 transform transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </section>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>